# Allow-list: the .vsix holds only what the extension reads at runtime.
# Everything is excluded, then each runtime file is named below, so a file or
# folder added to the repository is never packaged unless it is listed here.
# vsce applies "!" patterns whatever their order. Check with `npx vsce ls`.
**

# Manifest and Marketplace page (vsce adds its own manifest files)
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Icons: the extension icon (package.json "icon") and the file / editor icon
!media/icon.png
!media/icon_viridis_bold_monochromatic.svg

# Extension host compiled by tsc (main: out/src/extension.js). No source maps:
# they point to TypeScript sources that are not packaged.
!out/src/**/*.js

# Webview: the esbuild bundle, and the stylesheet read from src/ at runtime
# (WEBVIEW_STYLESHEET in src/panel/WebviewAssets.ts)
!out/webview/webview.js
!src/panel/webview/styles.css

# Python backend run by the extension (no tests, tools, sample generators,
# notebooks or __pycache__)
!python/get_data_info.py
!python/check_package_availability.py
!python/sdv_backend/**/*.py
